  "factor_name": "Conditional slow residual shock reversal",
  "version": "1.0",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "gate * (-rolling_sum(cross_sectional_residual_return, 10).shift(1) / rolling_std(asset_return, 30).shift(1))",
    "description": "Ranks assets for reversal of a lagged 10-day cross-sectional residual shock, risk-scaled by lagged 30-day volatility. Signal is active only when lagged downside breadth is 60%-87% and the lagged 20-day mean market return is negative. All inputs are lagged to avoid look-ahead. Positive values indicate stronger expected forward returns."
  },
